This is a fork of github.com/vectorcore-mobile/vectorcore-smsc (upstream commit 790790a),
maintained by itskimffs.

Modifications in this fork (itskimffs, 2026-10 and 2026-11); each modified file carries a notice:
- ISC third-party REGISTER keeps the S-CSCF port from the Via header, so MT MESSAGEs reach an S-CSCF on a non-default port (internal/sip/isc/register.go)
- Alphanumeric originating address: Address-Length counts useful semi-octets (TS 23.040 9.1.2.5), not septets (internal/codec/tpdu/encode.go)
- SMPP message IDs start at the start time in nanoseconds, so they do not repeat after a restart (internal/smpp/server/session.go, internal/smpp/client/session.go)
